# IPv6 destinations the relay and its unit refuse, one prefix per line. The
# NixOS module renders this same file into the relay service's
# IPAddressDeny= (comments and blank lines stripped). The guest stack is IPv4
# only; `::/0` is the whole-family denial the contract requires.
::/128
::1/128
::/0
fc00::/7
fd00:ec2::254
fe80::/10
ff00::/8
